<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0090_D26R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rThe lookout up top dipped when\nI hollered at him.\rThen I fell straight down the well.\rLanded flat on my back,\nnow I can’t move. My back is SHOT.\rDang! If I was fit, I’d’ve\nrocked all them Feds myself...\rAh, can’t be helped.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, go show them Feds who\ndeadass run this town!</language>
	</row>
</body>
